      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norton_Shores%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Fruit farming soon followed lumber, with growers shipping berries from local docks to Chicago steamers via Lake Michigan.",
